# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — sse2neon.h 被 CMake install EXCLUDE 但业务头无条件下 include ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-22
# Software: emhash 1.2.0
# Gate: 消费者编译（OHOS aarch64）
# Status: UNMATCHED — E999-DBE7（-msse2 旗标）与 E555/E554（sse2neon 库自身测试）均非本模式，待 promote
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv

id: DRAFT-emhash-1.2.0-sse2neon-install-excluded-but-consumed
severity: 2
category: ohos, headers, cmake, packaging, aarch64
trigger_tool: clang++|cmake|conan
phase: compilation|packaging
approach: header-only conan 配方 package() 显式拷贝被 CMake install EXCLUDE 的
  转译/兼容头（sse2neon.h）到 include/，与上游自带 conanfile.py 行为一致；消费者
  aarch64 编译运行实测验证；业务头条件编译时（仅 x86 include）无需补拷

keywords: sse2neon, emilib, SSE2, NEON, aarch64, install EXCLUDE, header-only, 转译头

error_signature: 'sse2neon\.h' file not found|sse2neon\.h.*No such file|emilib/.*fatal error.*sse2neon
match_keywords: sse2neon,emilib,install,EXCLUDE,aarch64,NEON,header-only,file not found

root_cause: 官方 CMakeLists install 以 PATTERN "sse2neon.h" EXCLUDE 排除第三方
  SSE2→NEON shim，但业务头 emilib/*.hpp 在 aarch64 上无条件下 #include <sse2neon.h>
  → 官方 CMake install 产物缺该头，消费者 aarch64 编译失败；上游 conanfile.py 的
  package() 显式拷贝该头印证其必须随包分发
affected_scope: 任意业务头 SSE2 转译依赖 sse2neon.h（或被 CMake install 排除头）的
  header-only 库落地 OHOS aarch64；emhash 1.2.0 实测（test_ohos 首错与修复）；
  E999-DBE7（-msse2 旗标）与 E555/E554（sse2neon 自身测试）不覆盖本模式

prescan_pattern: sse2neon\.h|PATTERN\s+"[^"]*" EXCLUDE|#include\s*[<"]sse2neon\.h[>"]
prescan_globs: "*.hpp, *.h, CMakeLists.txt, conanfile.py"